        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🌌 Aether’s Echo: Yazid’s Paradox</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A 2D platformer where time bends—and so do your limits.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“The mountain remembers every soul it devoured. Will you be the one to rewrite fate?”</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Precision meets puzzle. Every step matters.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🧭 Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a <strong>perilous journey</strong> through a mysterious mountain where time obeys your command—but so does your <strong>darkest self</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <u>Aether’s Echo: Yazid’s Paradox</u>, you play as <strong>Yazid</strong>, a mute but determined child armed with nothing but <strong>grit</strong> and the ability to <strong>rewind time</strong>. Every chapter introduces <strong>new gameplay twists</strong>—making your path feel fresh, brutal, and never forgiving.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🌀 Core Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕒 <strong>Time-Rewind Mechanic</strong><br>Perfect your moves or solve clever puzzles by reversing time. But be warned: <strong>not everything can be undone</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 <strong>Evolving Challenges</strong><br>Face shadowy clones, unpredictable traps, and <strong>yourself</strong>—literally.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌄 <strong>Atmospheric Storytelling</strong><br>Encounter a cryptic shopkeeper, a sinister doppelgänger, and uncover the <strong>haunting mystery</strong> of the mountain.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎵 <strong>Original Art &amp; Soundtrack</strong><br>A handcrafted pixel-art world paired with an <strong>emotive score</strong> designed to immerse and unsettle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌓 <strong>Two Sides of Power</strong><br>Time is your gift—and your curse. Can you resist the mountain's pull, or will you become another forgotten echo?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Every leap is a lesson. Every mistake, a second chance—or your last.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎮 Inspired By Greatness</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you loved <strong>Celeste</strong>, <strong>Braid</strong>, or any game that trades easy wins for <strong>hard-earned triumph</strong>, <i>Aether’s Echo: Yazid’s Paradox</i> was made for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704160/extras/Aether_Jumps.gif?t=1768750820\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >❄️ A Tale of Determination and Dread</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mountain has consumed <strong>stronger, greedier souls</strong> before you.<br>But Yazid is different.<br>With time on your side—and against it—can you survive the climb?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704160/extras/aether_glides.gif?t=1768750820\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛒 <strong>Wishlist now</strong> and be ready to test your <strong>mind, reflexes, and resolve</strong> when <u>Aether’s Echo: Yazid’s Paradox</u> launches soon on <strong>Steam</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
